{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"51","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Three Base Stations"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The New Vasjuki village is stretched along the motorway and that's why every house on it is characterized by its shift relative to some fixed point — the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":" coordinate. The village consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" houses, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th house is located in the point with coordinates of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xi"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"TELE3, a cellular communication provider planned to locate three base stations so as to provide every house in the village with cellular communication. The base station having power "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" located in the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" provides with communication all the houses on the segment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"[t - d, t + d]"},{"kind":"text","text":" (including boundaries)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To simplify the integration (and simply not to mix anything up) all the three stations are planned to possess the equal power of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":". Which minimal value of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":" is enough to provide all the houses in the village with cellular communication."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 2·105"},{"kind":"text","text":") which represents the number of houses in the village. The second line contains the coordinates of houses — the sequence "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1, x2, ..., xn"},{"kind":"text","text":" of integer numbers ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ xi ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":"). It is possible that two or more houses are located on one point. The coordinates are given in a arbitrary order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the required minimal power "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d"},{"kind":"text","text":". In the second line print three numbers — the possible coordinates of the base stations' location. Print the coordinates with 6 digits after the decimal point. The positions of the stations can be any from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2·109"},{"kind":"text","text":" inclusively. It is accepted for the base stations to have matching coordinates. If there are many solutions, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 2 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0.500000\n1.500000 2.500000 3.500000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n10 20 30\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n10.000000 20.000000 30.000000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n10003 10004 10001 10002 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0.500000\n1.000000 10001.500000 10003.500000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"51C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/51/problem/C"}